			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760380409,
					"content": "（或許<color=#FFCC33FF>菲林斯</color>會對糖雕有興趣…？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380401
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760380401,
					"content": "烏娜亞塔小姐。如果可以，請為我做一份糖雕吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380402,
					"content": "好啊，你是…那位執燈士，菲林斯先生吧，我之前在商店裡看過你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏娜亞塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380403,
					"content": "是的。我偶爾回來採購物資，您能記得我，是我的榮幸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380404,
					"content": "今天剛好路過此處，看見了您高超的糖雕技藝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380405,
					"content": "考慮再三後，我還是想要請您為我做一份糖雕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲林斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380406,
					"content": "哎呀，別這麼客氣，我都要不好意思了~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380407
					],
