					"nextDialogs": [
						760380909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏娜亞塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380909,
					"content": "很好看，謝謝妳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380910,
					"content": "嘿嘿，妳喜歡就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏娜亞塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380911,
					"content": "（沒錯，我的直覺告訴我，這種輕飄飄的造型，就適合這種輕飄飄的孩子！）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏娜亞塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380912,
					"content": "唔，也很好吃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380913,
					"content": "可以再幫我做兩份嗎？我想帶回去，給月靈們也嚐嚐。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380914,
					"content": "給…給月靈們也嚐嚐？可以倒是可以，但我的食材不太夠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "烏娜亞塔"
				},
				{
					"id": 760380915,
					"content": "嗯，那我明天再來。帶著月靈一起來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760380916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「少女」"
				},
				{
